docs {
  ## Create Gig Order — Own Gig

  Tests the edge case where the buyer is also the seller of the gig.
  Replace `OWN_GIG_UUID` with a gig owned by the authenticated user.

  Expected: 400 Bad Request — "You cannot purchase your own gig"
}
